{"id": "t071-009", "text": "chen called, mtg w his manager wed at 2 abt redundancies. whole dept is at risk apparently and he only just finished paying off the car. his wife is on mat leave w their 2nd so its terrible timing. he's applied for a couple of internal roles just in case, one in compliance. sounds rough. i should check in after the mtg wed evening, maybe offer to look over his cv", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "chen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mtg", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "wed at 2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on mat leave", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applied for a couple of internal roles", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "rough", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the mtg", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "wed evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to look over his cv", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
