{"id": "t071-059", "text": "long chat w chidi after church. his son Joe has his finals in june 2027, final yr engineering at imperial, and wants to go into renewables. chidi's worried abt the job market. meanwhile chidi himself is retiring from the nhs on 31 March 2027, 35 yrs, and his wife Chantal is throwing a party for him that sat, 3 April at 7pm. need to rsvp by end of month and think abt a gift, he's into gardening and jazz", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after church"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finals", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in june 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "final yr engineering at imperial", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to go into renewables", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried abt the job market", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring from the nhs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "31 March 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chantal", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that sat, 3 April at 7pm", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "rsvp", "owner": "p5", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of month", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "think abt a gift", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gardening", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "jazz", "owner": "p1"}]}
